<!--
    Overlay on Playnite Default/Media.xaml.
    Icon set: Pixelarticons 2.4.1 (MIT, info/LICENSE-pixelarticons.txt), drawn in whole pixels on a 24px grid, the
    closest open set to Terraria's pixel-art interface. The game's own icons are Re-Logic's artwork and are not used.
    art/icons.py lists every source and writes the geometries below and the menu PNGs.

    One geometry per role Playnite's chrome needs (Icon + role), plus the dropdown, submenu and check indicators and the
    game page icons, drawn by IconTemplate in the inherited foreground, aliased so the pixels stay square. Shown at
    IconSize (24) they are drawn one to one. IconMainMenu is this theme's own mark, a pixel tree on a strip of ground,
    drawn by hand in art/icons.py on a 16px grid and scaled onto 24.

    Menu icons (main menu, game menu) are theme file paths: Playnite's MenuHelpers.GetIcon loads a string resource as an
    image through ThemeFile. Images/Pixel holds them at 48px (two screen pixels per icon pixel) in white, the favorite
    star in the gold coin color and quit and remove in the Red rarity color.
-->
<ResourceDictionary xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
                    xmlns:sys="clr-namespace:System;assembly=mscorlib">

